,"document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423150003:1":{"text":"조아 스승님의 모아 강철 연구 방식에는 심각한 문제가 있어.","source_cn":"我觉得祖娅老师的魔钢研究方案有不可忽视的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE93FCC02781AADD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1423150003":{"text":"조아 스승님의 모아 강철 연구 방식에는 심각한 문제가 있어.","source_cn":"我觉得祖娅老师的魔钢研究方案有不可忽视的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE93FCC02781AADD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423150004:1":{"text":"광석에 마력을 직접 주입하면 주입량을 통일하기 어렵잖아. 간단하게는 광석 몇 개겠지만, 모아 강철 전체에 주입된 마력의 양이 들쑥날쑥해질 수도 있어.","source_cn":"如果依靠人工给矿石注入魔力的话，完全无法保证注入的程度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DEF57386FC8458C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423150005:1":{"text":"그렇다는 건 무기 원재료의 품질을 보장할 수 없다는 말이기도 해!","source_cn":"也就是说，完全无法保证武器原材料的品质！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF98439C6C10F6DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423150006:1":{"text":"깊은바위 마을이 자랑하는 생산 라인은 일관적인 무기 품질이야. 그 덕분에 품질을 중요하게 여기는 사람들의 선택을 받을 수 있었던 거고!","source_cn":"但是深岩村的生产线最自豪的就是能保证武器的品质一致，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F36B0BBE4EC5BF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423150007:1":{"text":"이러면 마을의 생산량은 회복할 수 있겠지만, 마을의 명성이 박살 날 거야!","source_cn":"这样村里的生产是恢复了，可村子的金字招牌也要砸了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AC292E51CCF16C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423150008:1":{"text":"그런 문제가 실제로 생길 수는 있겠지. 하지만 인원을 더 투입하고 기술 검수를 강화하면 불가능한 일은 아니야!","source_cn":"你说的这种情况是有发生的可能，可到时候加派几道人手，加...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2681C217D2B4E7AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423150009:1":{"text":"하지만 아직 마력이 광석의 성질에 어떻게 영향을 미치는 지도 모르잖습니까...","source_cn":"我们现在甚至对魔力影响矿石性质的原理都不清不楚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47ABF7BCB2825561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423150010:1":{"text":"그것도 샘플에 충분해야 제대로 연구라도 해볼 수 있지...","source_cn":"这得有了足够的样品量，才能慢慢研究……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BD52D3EAEFA0049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423150011:1":{"text":"그래, 후긴이 이렇게 지적한 이상 못 들은 척은 할 수 없지.","source_cn":"好吧，既然呼金指出了方案的问题，我总不能装作什么都没听见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB73B61908D2B73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423150012:1":{"text":"셀로클랜드에서 광석에 마력을 주입할 제사장들을 보내줬어. 광석 품질이 어떤지 직접 확인하러 가보자.","source_cn":"萨洛克兰已经派了几位祭司进行给矿石注魔的工作了，我们去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x472878848E0D61DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"무슨 문제야?","source_cn":"有什么问题？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x160A2B35C9F7677B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"무슨 문제야?","female":"무슨 문제야?","variant_male_record_index":"73690","variant_female_record_index":"73691","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"무슨 일인데?","source_cn":"发生什么了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x02B633514EE55935","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"무슨 일인데?","female":"무슨 일인데?","variant_male_record_index":"73692","variant_female_record_index":"73693","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14231510.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231510","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423151001:0":{"text":"아이언비어드, 마력 주입은 잘 되어가고 있어?","source_cn":"铁须，注魔的情况怎么样了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8382719DFFEC78E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14231530.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231530","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231530","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423153001:0":{"text":"아이언비어드, 지금 마력 주입이랑 모아 강철 제련 상황은 어때?","source_cn":"铁须，现在矿石注魔和魔钢冶炼的情况怎么样了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35297B7EE5104A1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423153002:1":{"text":"너무... 실망스러워!","source_cn":"真是……太让人失望了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14555E9199FD3AA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423153003:1":{"text":"난 애초에 이 마력 주입이라는 게 못 믿을 방법이라고 생각했다고. 역시 형제들을 이끌고 떠났어야 했는데... 이젠 그놈의 뾰족귀들이랑 손을 잡은 덕분에 떠나지도 못하잖아...","source_cn":"我早就觉得什么注魔不靠谱，就该拉着大伙一起走的……现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEC57A0832DE6055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423153004:1":{"text":"대체 무슨 일인데 그래!","source_cn":"到底怎么了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D2B57280AC4E1F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423153005:1":{"text":"여기, 제련소에서 막 찍어낸 블루모아 강철 좀 보라고. 마침 뾰족귀들에게 돌려보내려던 참이었어. 이게 합격인지 직접 확인해 봐!","source_cn":"我这放着冶炼所刚锻打出来的蓝魔钢锭，正要退给这些尖耳朵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A4E51FA6EDF38CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:铁须":{"text":"아이언비어드","source":"铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14231540.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231540","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231540","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423154001:1":{"text":"고작 이 정도의 합격률로 뭘 어쩌려고 하는 거야?","source_cn":"你们看看！合格率这么低，要怎么跟大伙交待！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF00EC7E93EDF82A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423154002:1":{"text":"방법을 다시 생각해봐야겠어. 일단 품질이 좋은 모아 강철부터 생산 라인에 투입하고...","source_cn":"我再想想办法，先把质量合格的魔钢投进生产线……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD1DA04049FC115A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423154003:1":{"text":"...더는 못 해먹겠군. 계약을 1회분만 한 걸 다행으로 생각해, 조아! 협력인지 뭔지, 당장 때려치우고 발 빼자고.","source_cn":"……恕我不奉陪了。幸好签的协议只是第一期，祖娅，你尽快...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC77979C4F0E3EEA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423154004:1":{"text":"어이, 거기 다들! 손에 든 거 내려놔. 마을로 돌아간다!","source_cn":"大伙们，把手里的活停下吧，我们回村去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB4CC1DFAD341DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423154005:1":{"text":"아이언비어드, 잠깐! 아휴...","source_cn":"铁须，你等等！唉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06DA17A3D0317643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423154006:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 내가 잘못된 길을 가고 있는 걸까? 왜 이렇게 모든 일이 힘들지...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x64A63F4C3826A945","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 내가 잘못된 길을 가고 있는 걸까? 왜 이렇게 모든 일이 힘들지...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 내가 잘못된 길을 가고 있는 걸까? 왜 이렇게 모든 일이 힘들지...","variant_male_record_index":"168969","variant_female_record_index":"168970","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423154007:1":{"text":"됐어, 너에게 이런 고민까지 털어놓는 건 아닌 것 같아. 혼자서 생각 좀 정리해 볼게.","source_cn":"算了，这些事不该来烦你，我一个人考虑考虑吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2E874DACCDECB30C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"됐어, 너에게 이런 고민까지 털어놓는 건 아닌 것 같아. 혼자서 생각 좀 정리해 볼게.","female":"됐어, 너에게 이런 고민까지 털어놓는 건 아닌 것 같아. 혼자서 생각 좀 정리해 볼게.","variant_male_record_index":"168971","variant_female_record_index":"168972","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423154008:1":{"text":"조아 스승님...","source_cn":"祖娅老师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23BDE88A6719E02F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1423154009:0":{"text":"조아는 깊은 생각에 잠긴 채 조용히 자리를 떠났다.\n밤이 되도록 조아는 돌아오지 않았다...","source_cn":"祖娅沉思着独自离开了。\\n一直到晚上，她都没有出现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6477BA1BCAD45F3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1423154010:0":{"text":"조아의 상태가 마음에 걸리니, 조아를 찾아가 이야기를 나눠보기로 했다.","source_cn":"不放心祖娅的情况，你决定找到她，跟她聊聊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDF2DBF42ECDA285E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조아의 상태가 마음에 걸리니, 조아를 찾아가 이야기를 나눠보기로 했다.","female":"조아의 상태가 마음에 걸리니, 조아를 찾아가 이야기를 나눠보기로 했다.","variant_male_record_index":"168975","variant_female_record_index":"168976","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:铁须":{"text":"아이언비어드","source":"铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14231550.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231550","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231550","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423155001:0":{"text":"조아가 마을에 없네... 마을 밖으로 나간 걸까?","source_cn":"祖娅不在村里……难道是去了村子外面？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0EFFB8B3A3191DE8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조아가 마을에 없네... 마을 밖으로 나간 걸까?","female":"조아가 마을에 없네... 마을 밖으로 나간 걸까?","variant_male_record_index":"168977","variant_female_record_index":"168978","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14231560.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231560","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231560","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423156001:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너구나.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBF7189C88E5068A2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너구나.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너구나.","variant_male_record_index":"168979","variant_female_record_index":"168980","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423156002:0":{"text":"걱정 마. 그냥 벽에 부딪힌 것 같아서 혼자서 맥주나 마시면서 생각을 정리하고 있었어.","source_cn":"别担心了，我就是遇到瓶颈了，一个人在这儿喝喝啤酒，散散心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2894807468E41DA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423156003:1":{"text":"네가 보기에... 모아 강철 연구는 정말 가능성이 없는 것 같아?","source_cn":"在你看来，你觉得魔钢研究真的行不通吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3393DF44CA78E44B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 보기에... 모아 강철 연구는 정말 가능성이 없는 것 같아?","female":"네가 보기에... 모아 강철 연구는 정말 가능성이 없는 것 같아?","variant_male_record_index":"168982","variant_female_record_index":"168983","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1423156003":{"text":"네가 보기에... 모아 강철 연구는 정말 가능성이 없는 것 같아?","source_cn":"在你看来，你觉得魔钢研究真的行不通吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3393DF44CA78E44B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 보기에... 모아 강철 연구는 정말 가능성이 없는 것 같아?","female":"네가 보기에... 모아 강철 연구는 정말 가능성이 없는 것 같아?","variant_male_record_index":"168982","variant_female_record_index":"168983","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423156004:1":{"text":"나도 그러기를 바라. 하지만 당장 눈 앞의 기술 문제도 해결하지 못하니...","source_cn":"我也是这么希望的，可是现在眼前的技术难题就无法解决啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x560D4B098DEF59F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423156006:1":{"text":"그럼 이제 뭘 어떻게 해야 하지?","source_cn":"那我该怎么做呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E25F27EECE4D719","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1423156006":{"text":"그럼 이제 뭘 어떻게 해야 하지?","source_cn":"那我该怎么做呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E25F27EECE4D719","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423156007:1":{"text":"네 말이 맞아! 요즘 이 지긋지긋한 일들에 너무 시달렸던 것 같아. 오늘만큼은 제대로 쉬어야지!","source_cn":"你说的对！我已经被这些糟心事烦了太久了，今天我要痛痛快...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C9B0AC94F29842C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네 말이 맞아! 요즘 이 지긋지긋한 일들에 너무 시달렸던 것 같아. 오늘만큼은 제대로 쉬어야지!","female":"네 말이 맞아! 요즘 이 지긋지긋한 일들에 너무 시달렸던 것 같아. 오늘만큼은 제대로 쉬어야지!","variant_male_record_index":"168987","variant_female_record_index":"168988","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"잠깐 쉬는 게 어때?","source_cn":"给自己放个假吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x68302D283B151089","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"잠깐 쉬는 게 어때?","female":"잠깐 쉬는 게 어때?","variant_male_record_index":"73698","variant_female_record_index":"73699","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"복잡한 생각은 잠깐 접어두자","source_cn":"先别想这些事了吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC45520573F41D7F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"복잡한 생각은 잠깐 접어두자","female":"복잡한 생각은 잠깐 접어두자","variant_male_record_index":"73700","variant_female_record_index":"73701","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"가능성 있어","source_cn":"行得通","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2BDD5BDFBFA58B29","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"가능성 있어","female":"가능성 있어","variant_male_record_index":"73694","variant_female_record_index":"73695","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423156005:1":{"text":"...그런가. 가능성이 있으면 내가 지금 여기서 이러고 있진 않겠지.","source_cn":"……是啊。如果行得通的话，我现在也不会在这儿了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2B15C2CE59CB8D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","